					<h2><a href="index.html%3Fp=955" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to Kirtan &#8220;Manny&#8221; ManWoman">Kirtan &#8220;Manny&#8221; ManWoman</a></h2>
					<!-- p class="post-info">Nov 14th, 2012 by <a href="http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?author=3" title="Posts by khushi" rel="author">khushi</a> </p -->
					<p class="post-meta"><ul class='post-meta'>
</ul>
</p>
